import{_ as t,o as i,c as o,a2 as s}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 273 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Youth Supremes' Situation: The Bestowal Attribute of the Genius Mechanism","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 273 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Youth Supremes' Situation: The Bestowal Attribute of the Genius Mechanism","no":273,"module":2,"tags":["Tang-Luo","Youth Supremes","Genius Mechanism","Bestowal Attribute","Myriad-Realms Benchmark"],"related":["08-Everyone-Has-a-Road Guarantee System","23-20% Activation Strategy Plan","37-Symbiotic Education System"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0273_模块2-唐罗-少年至尊处境.md","filePath":"en/0273_模块2-唐罗-少年至尊处境.md"}`),n={name:"en/0273_模块2-唐罗-少年至尊处境.md"};function a(r,e,l,u,h,c){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[s('<h1 id="entry-273-tang-luo-decomposition-youth-supremes-situation-the-bestowal-attribute-of-the-genius-mechanism" tabindex="-1">Entry 273 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Youth Supremes&#39; Situation: The Bestowal Attribute of the Genius Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-273-tang-luo-decomposition-youth-supremes-situation-the-bestowal-attribute-of-the-genius-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 273 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Youth Supremes&#39; Situation: The Bestowal Attribute of the Genius Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Tang-Luo System (Entry 23)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-genius-is-not-a-bestowal-toy" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Genius is not a bestowal toy <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-genius-is-not-a-bestowal-toy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Genius is not a bestowal toy&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires all beings to have equal evolution qualification; the collective ascension axiom requires no wasting big talent on small tasks. Youth Supremes in the Tang-Luo system — those child-prodigy geniuses — on the surface are darlings, actually are bestowal system specimens. This entry takes the law-first axiom as core. Protagonist uniqueness dependency judgment: <strong>Tang Luo = high dependency / bestowal-style civilization</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Youth Supremes mechanism&#39;s energy-level waste:</p><ul><li><strong>Sample bias</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s genius selection concentrates on youths he can see and reach. Geniuses in remote areas, from bottom families, among foreign races are overlooked because they are not &quot;seen&quot;</li><li><strong>Fast-track dependency</strong>: selected Youth Supremes enjoy Tang Luo&#39;s personal coaching and top-tier resource tilt. They grow fast, but their growth path is locked by Tang Luo&#39;s eye — whichever direction Tang Luo favors, they go that way; multiple possibilities are compressed</li><li><strong>Forced growth</strong>: concentrating resources too early, Youth Supremes reach at twenty what others reach at fifty. But foundation, character, experience cannot keep up with realm, late stage prone to collapse</li></ul><p>Energy-level waste: <strong>geniuses are cultivated as &quot;sage lord&#39;s works,&quot; not as &quot;masters of their own fate.&quot;</strong> This is the greatest waste of genius.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Genius generations broken</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s Youth Supreme generation was personally selected and taught by him. He retires, how does the next generation of genius get selected, who teaches them? Selection mechanism not institutionalized</li><li><strong>Looking only to the sage lord</strong>: Youth Supremes are used to &quot;being selected, being arranged,&quot; losing the courage to independently frontier. Tang Luo is here, they are sharp blades; Tang Luo is gone, they are scattered soldiers</li><li><strong>Lateral comparison missing</strong>: because resources concentrate on a few Youth Supremes, ordinary disciples have no chance to spar with them as equals. Genius lacks opponents, growth is actually constrained</li></ol><p>Regression form: Youth Supreme generation brilliant, second generation mediocre.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Selecting is possessing</strong>: Tang Luo selecting a youth is equivalent to declaring this youth &quot;belongs to me.&quot; Youth Supreme&#39;s identity, resources, path are all defined by Tang Luo. This is possession of genius subjectivity</li><li><strong>Fast-track is attachment</strong>: the faster Youth Supremes grow, the more dependent on Tang Luo. The higher their realm, the more they cannot leave Tang Luo&#39;s coaching. The flip side of fast-track is attachment</li><li><strong>Specimenization</strong>: Youth Supremes are displayed as &quot;Tang Luo&#39;s good-policy results,&quot; used to prove universal benefit works. They are civilization&#39;s showrooms, not independent individuals</li></ul><p>By the Gu Chensha / Tang Luo judgment table standard: Tang Luo = <strong>enlightened predator</strong>, the Youth Supremes mechanism is his predation structure&#39;s concrete form of &quot;genius possession.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Tang-Luo Youth Supremes</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Genius Mechanism</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Tang Luo personally selects</td><td>Alaya Network monitors whole-population talent, auto-identifies</td></tr><tr><td>Fast-track + attachment</td><td>&quot;Fast-track + Quest&quot; dual routes, Youth Supremes choose fast or steady</td></tr><tr><td>One-person coaching</td><td>Cross-plane mentor network, multiple mentors collaboratively</td></tr><tr><td>Path locked</td><td>300 systems fully open, geniuses choose direction themselves</td></tr><tr><td>Specimenization</td><td>20% Activation Strategy: each generation batch-produces strong ones, not specimens</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Alternative&#39;s crux: turn &quot;sage lord&#39;s work&quot; into &quot;network node.&quot; Geniuses do not need to be selected, they need to be seen — after being seen, they walk the road themselves.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Tang-Luo Youth Supreme selection model</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: Group A sage lord selects talents; Group B network selects talents</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: total genius output within a hundred years, genius independent innovation rate</li><li><strong>Review expectation</strong>: Group B genius total ten times Group A, independent innovation rate significantly higher</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-high</strong>. Youth Supremes are web-novel standard</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Long-form writing if it needs stronger villains, the cheapest move is temporarily letting some Youth Supreme &quot;suddenly erupt&quot; — talent numbers stretch with plot</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: high</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: geniuses cultivated as works, subjectivity deprived</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: selecting is possessing, fast-track is attachment</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo selects talents by eye; Heng Yuan Zhou selects talents by network</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: genius selection must cover 99%, not only reach youths who are seen</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: batch genius output can support cross-plane civilization</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-discussion-de-bestowal-of-the-genius-mechanism" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Discussion: De-Bestowal of the Genius Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-discussion-de-bestowal-of-the-genius-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Discussion: De-Bestowal of the Genius Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Youth Supremes&#39; situation in the Tang-Luo system is essentially the bestowal mechanism&#39;s product — geniuses are selected, cultivated, entrusted with missions, but choice is not in their own hands. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s alternative is Youth Supreme dual-track: fast-track and Quest-track run in parallel, choice lies with the cultivator. The Alaya Network provides path evaluation, does not make decisions for people. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s law-first axiom ensures genius growth is not plot-kidnapped, growth rhythm decided by law-cognition maturity. The universal equal infinite law ensures unselected ordinary geniuses also have complete paths.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Youth Supremes are not Tang Luo&#39;s private property, they are civilization&#39;s kindling. Tang Luo holds the kindling in his palm, very warm; but the kindling should be scattered, letting the whole prairie burn. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s 20% Activation Strategy is the way to scatter kindling.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./08-人人有路保障体系.html">08-Everyone-Has-a-Road Guarantee System</a> · <a href="./23-20%激活战略规划.html">23-20% Activation Strategy Plan</a> · <a href="./37-共生教育体系.html">37-Symbiotic Education System</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const m=t(n,[["render",a]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
